ull,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/105700","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105700","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105700.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105700.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-28T00:27:05Z"},"body":"Return `Vector<String>` directly instead of passing in a `List<String>` pointer into `ConfigFile::get_sections` and `get_section_keys`.\r\n\r\nAlso removed the private functions `_get_sections` and `_get_section_keys` that were used for the bindings as all they did was copy the List into a Vector.\r\n\r\nI tested with 200 keys and 200 sections and it was about 3x faster with the Vector. I also tested out if passing the Vector as a pointer like the List was doing initially was better but it ended up being much slower than just returning it by value.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105700/reactions","total_count":19,"+1":10,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoora